Exclusion criteria

* pregnancy or breastfeeding
* any other medical conditions affecting by itself balance and gait (e.g. lower limb amputation, hemiparesis due to a stroke)
* major orthopaedic surgery (e.g. hip or knee replacement).

Inclusion Criteria:

